 "rules": [
  "A record with no class is CC2; with a class at level 1, CC3; with a class above level 1, CC4. No version writes more than it needs, so the bytes of an older record never change.",
  "hood is 1 exactly when part 26 or part 39 is worn.",
  "A man's hair is 0 to 2.",
  "The reader keeps only worn parts that can be chosen, and a piece that cannot be chosen reads as 18.",
  "The reader takes a record whole or not at all: a refused record leaves the kept character as it was."
